        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents, The Dublin Property Experts, are delighted to present Apartment 32 Cameron Court to the Dublin 8 property market. \r\n\r\nThis superb apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors to acquire a spacious and well-located home within walking distance of Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming hallway, large open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area - perfect for both relaxing and entertaining, a generously sized bedroom along with a bathroom and two additional storage closets.\r\n\r\nThe location of Cameron Court is truly second to none, offering a perfect blend of city-centre energy and local community charm. You are situated within a 15-minute walk of St. Stephen’s Green and the heart of the city, with the Coombe Maternity Hospital and the Digital Hub just moments away. For the commuter, several major bus routes pass right by your front door, and the Red Luas line is reachable within a short stroll. With a wealth of trendy cafes, traditional pubs, and modern supermarkets all on your doorstep, this is urban living at its absolute finest.\r\n\r\nWe highly recommend scheduling a viewing at your earliest convenience.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** While we have carefully compiled all information to ensure accuracy to the best of our knowledge, some details may have been provided by the vendor. We do not accept responsibility for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and advise viewers to seek their own opinion on any concerns they may have."
